0:["PTF5f6zbP51hXl6zOpnuH",[[["",{"children":["explainer-video-voice",{"children":["__PAGE__",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":["explainer-video-voice",{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",["$","main",null,{"className":"inner-page","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"inner-hero","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-container","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h1>Explaining the <span class=\"ident\">Explainer video</span> voice </h1>\r\n<p>The Explainer video voice is one picked on it’s ability to make these 1 - 2 minute website videos have impact. <br>\r\nMy voice is heard on hundreds of Web videos. YouTube is alive with work. Why not request a sample of your script?</p>"}}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-bar"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-parallax","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-container","children":[[["$","div","0",{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><span class=\"ident\">Web</span> Videos</h2>\r\n<p>There are some fantastic Explainer video producing companies making some awesome videos and animations. Believe me, I’m working with them. So, your hard work and product should be represented with a credible voice. Working with major brands daily I know how to make your words sound great.</p>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined","$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://player.vimeo.com/video/134788599","title":"Vimeo video","allow":"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}],"$undefined"]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"inner-row reverse","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><span class=\"ident\">Who</span> to use?</h2>\r\n<p>Now, I’m not saying you have to book me. If I’m not right for your brand, I won’t take money from a client who could go away un happy. I’ll happily offer an alternative voice. It’s really quite easy, if you need a more mature sound, a regional accent or maybe the product calls for a female voice? I’ll help, no problem.</p>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined","$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://player.vimeo.com/video/142797450","title":"Vimeo video","allow":"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}],"$undefined"]}]]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><span class=\"ident\">Simple</span> and Easy</h2>\r\n<p>Do you want a voiceover that wants to make the process as smooth as possible? Do you want to get along with the voice and them not be awkward and un co-operative? Will that voice charge you every time you need it tweaking or amending? Do you want them hounding you if you haven’t paid within 2 days? Of course not. So, try me.</p>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined","$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://player.vimeo.com/video/184425590","title":"Vimeo video","allow":"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}],"$undefined"]}]]}],["$","div","3",{"className":"inner-row reverse","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><span class=\"ident\">How</span> it works</h2>\r\n<p>It’s not rocket science, it’s a voice over. However, you need the job done properly! If you choose me, thank you. I will of course offer to read a couple of lines first to check I’m the right voice for your brand. Avoid going for cheap options. Is your brand in safe hands?</p>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined","$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://player.vimeo.com/video/150788840","title":"Vimeo video","allow":"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}],"$undefined"]}]]}],["$","div","4",{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><span class=\"ident\">Lets</span> do it!</h2>\r\n<p>I’m voicing lots of Web, How 2 and Explainer videos daily. It never ceases to amaze me the content you guys create and then I get to place my vocals all over the top of it at the end. If you keep on creating and I’ll keep voicing.</p>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined","$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://player.vimeo.com/video/136879277","title":"Vimeo video","allow":"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}],"$undefined"]}]]}],["$","div","5",{"className":"inner-row reverse","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><span class=\"ident\">Web</span> & Explainer Voice!</h2>\r\n<p>Web Videos, How 2 Videos, Corporate, e-Learning videos or your Explainer Video Voice… Maybe I’ll be right for yours?\r\nIt’s pretty cool when I re-fresh my email and along comes a job and I think… Yeah… Nice! So, shall we talk? <br>Click <a href=\"/contact-guy\" class=\"isred\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"The Contact Page\">The Contact Page</a> to get in touch.</a></p>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined","$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://player.vimeo.com/video/134789150","title":"Vimeo video","allow":"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}],"$undefined"]}]]}],["$","div","6",{"className":"inner-full","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Explainers or web videos are a visual way of putting the message across whilst also forcing businesses to say more in less words.<br>\r\nIt’s job is add an audio enhancement to these short promotional videos of a company or brand. <br>\r\nWhy are they short? A user’s attention is a lot shorter these days and expect to be introduced to a product quickly.<br>\r\nI've voiced hundreds of explainer videos for global brands like Tesco, Vodafone, Sage, RBS, Unilever, John West, Coca Cola, Rolls Royce & N-Power.<br>\r\nShort 1-2 minute web videos are dominating home pages all over the web. But what is most important? The Voice!<br></p>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]],["$","$L2",null,{"pageTitle":"Explainer Video Voice Over - Guy Harris - Voiceovers 4 Web","pageUrl":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/explainer-video-voice"}]]}]}],[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"LocalBusiness\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/#business\",\"name\":\"Guy Harris Voiceover\",\"image\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/explainer-video-voice\",\"priceRange\":\"£100–£5000\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Wakefield\",\"addressRegion\":\"West Yorkshire\",\"addressCountry\":\"GB\"},\"openingHours\":\"Mo-Sa 07:00-21:00\",\"description\":\"Professional explainer video voiceover by Guy Harris. Broadcast-quality narration for corporate, product, and animated explainers.\"}"}}],["$","script","1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/explainer-video-voice#faq\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How much does an explainer video voiceover cost?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Explainer voiceover pricing depends on word count and usage. Most web-use projects start from £49.99 for short scripts. Contact Guy for a fast, no-obligation quote.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can Guy voice my explainer video the same day?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Guy delivers 99% of explainer voiceovers the same day, with broadcast-quality audio in MP3 or WAV format.\"}}]}"}}]]]}],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L3",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","explainer-video-voice","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L4",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[[[["$","link","0",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/ac5a13a32dde8802.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}]],["$","html",null,{"lang":"en-GB","children":[["$","head",null,{"children":[["$","link",null,{"rel":"icon","href":"/favicon.ico","sizes":"any"}],["$","link",null,{"rel":"icon","href":"/assets/images/voiceover-guy-icon.png","type":"image/png"}],["$","link",null,{"rel":"apple-touch-icon","href":"/assets/images/voiceover-guy-icon.png"}]]}],["$","body",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"top-bar"}],["$","$L5",null,{}],["$","main",null,{"children":["$","$L3",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L4",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":[["$","div",null,{"className":"pa